# SCAL-COVER-BISTRO: textures, translucency volume, software raster and the Quality panel (the other half of
# SCAL-COVER.scn: another project is another editor run).
# Conditions: PC unlocked, display on, VRAM below budget, machine.json without overrides; 300 frames before a dump.
# [vuid] editor.log has 0 VUID. [machine] machine.json is byte-identical after the run; a machine recommended by the
# v3 data is re-measured once on its next ordinary start and is not recommended Cinematic.
# BEFORE = the same shot on the dev tip before SCAL-COVER, put on the left of the side-by-side.
Проект ../BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Day.desce --gpu-profile
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -20,250,330
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,0.05,-0.8
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures Low"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид tx_low textures softer than tx_epic
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures High"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид tx_high sharper than tx_low; pool <= 1536 MB
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures Epic"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид tx_epic sharp; the [Memory] census pool does not fall Low <= High <= Epic, no budget warning
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures.MipBias 400"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид tx_mip400 terrain, decals and meshes softened alike
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures.MipBias Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Effects Low"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид fx_low smoke and glass lit, no blocks of the 32-cubed translucency volume
Когда run Quality "Quality: Effects Epic"
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance High"
Когда run Quality "Quality: VirtualGeometry.SoftwareRaster 0"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид sw_high_off the reference of sw_high; GPU ms noted
Когда run Quality "Quality: VirtualGeometry.SoftwareRaster 1"
Когда frames 300
Когда profile-dump
Тогда-вид sw_high equals sw_high_off, mean |diff| <= 2/255; GPU ms noted
Когда run Quality "Quality: VirtualGeometry.SoftwareRaster Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: AntiAliasing.TemporalQuality 1"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Textures.MipBias 50"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.RadiosityUpdateFactor 32"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.RadiosityProbeSpacing 8"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.RadiosityHemisphereProbeResolution 2"
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance.DrawDistanceScalePercent 80"
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance.LandscapeGridErrorPercent 200"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Foliage.InstanceDensityScalePercent 40"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Effects.CloudLightMarchSamples 8"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Effects.CloudShadowMapScalePercent 50"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Effects.CloudStopTransmittanceMilli 20"
Когда frames 60
Тогда-вид ui_all the Quality panel lists TemporalQuality, the three Radiosity rows, MipBias and the six new rows; every override above was accepted
